Algorithm FindPrimes
Input: startValue, endValue
Output: List of prime numbers between startValue and endValue inclusive

1. Read startValue, endValue
2. For i from startValue to endValue do
3.     If i <= 1 then
4.         Skip to next i (not prime)
5.     End If
6.     
7.     Set isPrime to true
8.     For j from 2 to sqrt(i) do
9.         If i modulo j == 0 then
10.            Set isPrime to false
11.            Break loop
12.        End If
13.    End For
14.    
15.    If isPrime == true then
16.        Print i
17.    End If
18. End For
End Algorithm
